Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(utils): add random integer, shuffle, and unique ID
 utilities

- randomInt and pickRandom accept an optional random source so tests
  can use a seeded generator
- calculateAnswer computes the exact result for each operation
- shuffle uses Fisher-Yates and returns a new array
- createId falls back when crypto.randomUUID is unavailable, which
  happens when the dev server is opened over plain HTTP from a tablet
- Add a seeded random generator for repeatable tests
- Add unit tests for each utility
